    "Details": "The Fortune Assault Vehicle, Wheeled is an 80 ton tank with a 220-rated Fusion Engine. A heavier replacement of the Hetzer Assault Gun, an LB-20X is paired with a LB-10X in a turret. A C3 Master unit allows the tank to act as a command vehicle.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       375     40\n<b>Left</b>         270     40\n<b>Right</b>       270     40\n<b>Rear</b>        195     40\n<b>Turret</b>      345     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      1455    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - AC</color>",
